	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The plaza in front of the Imperial Palace is filled by throngs of Tenkyo citizens.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"People from all walks of life are gathered here today to celebrate Elsa's inauguration as governor-general and to hear Empress Hisui speak.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"This will be her first public appearance since her so-called “impostor declaration.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"As such, it is only natural that the public awaits her speech with great interest.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Before Empress Hisui's address, however, Elsa first takes the podium.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is my great honor to stand before you today as the new governor-general of the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I am delighted from the bottom of my heart that so many citizens of the Empire have gathered here today to welcome me as your own.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Elsa moves on to speak of her grand vision for the future of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The people are shocked to hear that she intends to grant the Empire full independence in the near future, with Empress Hisui as its head of state.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"However, its political structure would be irrevocably altered.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The Empress would lose almost all legislative and executive authority, with governance left instead to a representative body elected by the people.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The Empire is to be reborn as a democracy.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"On the military front, Republican soldiers stationed in the Empire would be withdrawn to their homeland in stages.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Many commissioned officers such as Rochel have already departed in the first wave.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Today marks the dawn of a new age in the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“May each and every one of us contribute to building a lasting Empire where all can live in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Elsa concludes her speech and steps down from the podium.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is scheduled to deliver her address next.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"However, she hesitates to take the stage.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Would the people truly accept one such as me?)”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Someone so steeped in sin and deceit?)”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Go on, Your Majesty. Show the people just how well you're doing.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Yes...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Her unease casting a pallor over her, Empress Hisui hesitantly takes to the stage.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The next moment, however, the entire plaza is shaken by raucous cheers.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Huh...?)”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Empress Hisui can hardly believe her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"She had prepared herself to be met with harsh censure and condemnation, but every last face in the crowd is bright with cheer.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"Many of those gathered here today are waving little Imperial flags with all their might to give encouragement to their Empress who imagined the unimaginable due to “stress-related fatigue.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(They truly want me as their Empress?)”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Surrounded on all sides by the people's cheers, Empress Hisui recalls Akari's words.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were the one who kept the people's hope alive all this time when I could do nothing for them.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For ruling over the Empire when I was powerless to do so, you have my most sincere gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know that the people will be in very worthy hands moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(To think that all I ever wanted was Onii-sama...)”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's lineage is, indeed, nothing but a fabrication.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"But to the people, she alone is their Empress.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"For three long years after the war, it was none other but her who healed their wounded hearts and kept the flame of their hopes burning bright.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(How blind I have been all this time...)”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(I was so absorbed in my own selfish desires, I lost sight of all those who revere even one such as me...)”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"A substance more precious than any jewel or gemstone glistens on Empress Hisui's cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The guilt of layering falsehoods upon falsehoods still yet lingers within her heart.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"However, a newfound resolve, burning bright and clear, surges up within her.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"─I must protect my people.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You have my thanks for such a lavish ovation.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"The plaza falls perfectly silent.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I must first offer my deepest and humblest apologies, that my careless utterances have aroused such disquiet in your hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“However, I would make a proclamation to all those gathered here today.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui, the rightful ruler of this Empire, stands now before you.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"A chorus of cheers erupts from the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The Empire has only just embarked down the long road towards revival.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“The scars of the war have still yet to heal, and there are still many victims who have yet to be made whole again.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“But with Oomikami as my witness, I vow to you that I shall devote every effort towards forging a lasting peace, one that our future generations may someday inherit.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Thus and so, words of virtue extolling Empress Hisui ring out from every hill and valley across the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Far in the distance, I can spot Kanami as she basks in the adulation of the people's cheers.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Is it just my imagination?",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Or does her bearing seem a bit more regal than it did even just a few minutes prior?",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"No, there's no mistaking it...",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Seeing her radiant expression as she greets the crowd, it's clear as day that she's had a profound change of heart.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That girl's gonna be just fine, don'tcha think?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, we'll see, I guess.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh nooo, this guy's trying to play it all cool now.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You should've seen the big dumb grin you had on your face watching Kanami speak.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I have pictures.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not for long, you don't.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hehehee, Soujin-sama's just as smitten with Kanami-sama as everyone else.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I suppose no man is immune to the charms of his sister...”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha! That girl totally stole a march on you, didn't she, Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, shut it, Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I ignore my boisterous companions for the time being and gaze back upon Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I can't even begin to imagine the daunting hardships that will soon await her.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"As a warrior, all I have to offer is my blade.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"But as her brother and her man, I should be able to support her in matters unrelated to the blade.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd better work your butt off, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You don't need to tell me twice.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Though it may just be my imagination, I can't help but feel like she's meeting my gaze with her own.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“(Never could I have imagined that I might be blessed enough to live out the rest of my life alongside you, Onii-sama.)”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“(Though I have my duty to fulfill as Empress, all my heart belongs to you, Onii-sama.)”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“(An unworthy sister I may be, but please, continue to watch over your Kanami.)”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"That's what Kanami's eyes are saying.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Let us stick by each other as long as we live.)”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"The road before us is long and uncertain.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But no matter what hardships we face, will you give me yourself and travel it with me─",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"My Empress, my sister, my Kanami?",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
